The key insight from reading the upstream source: our keys are `(BlockId, usize, VarnodeSlot)` tuples ordered lexicographically. All entries for `(bid, idx, *)` form a **contiguous range** `[(bid, idx, MIN_SLOT) ..= (bid, idx, MAX_SLOT)]`. So I can replace the full `keys().filter()` scan with a bounded `range`/`extract_if`.

